  "critical_interface_gates": [
    "Existing seven-feature predictor includes TG-GATEs Low/Middle/High one-hot categories absent from the external design. Do not guess a category or silently encode all zeros. Predeclare and retrain a portable context using physical time and bilateral molar concentrations only, with selection using training data.",
    "Exact chemical features need provenance using the same PubChem fingerprint and descriptor contract; use CDDO-Me identity rather than CDDO free acid.",
    "Verify both human Entrez-to-Ensembl and rat Entrez-to-Ensembl bridges and paired orthology; reject ambiguity. The fixed intersection uses identifier, observed presence and human/rat finite-value rules only, without filtering for dog or other unused species.",
    "RMA log2 response and log2(CPM+1) response have different measurement contracts. Preserve cross-platform, low-count pseudocount and normalization limitations; no external-human-label scaling or calibration.",
    "The model is fitted without the external study; GSE330151 provides retrospective external-study evaluation.",
    "Three external drugs cannot establish broad independent-drug generalization or new-species selection; all three tasks and unfavorable results must be reported."
  ],
  "g300_table2_text": "2 Drugs and Concentrations Tested in This Study platform fialuridine ( C max = 1 μM) bosentan ( C max = 7.4 μM) chlorpromazine ( C max = 0.5 μM) exposure duration (days) EXP 1 PhysioMimix LC12 10 μM (10 × C max ) 10 μM (1.4 × C max ) 10 μM (20 × C max ) 4 96-well plate 1, 10, 30 μM (1–30 × C max ) 1, 10, 30 μM (0.1–4 × C max ) 1, 10, 30 μM (2–60 × C max ) 4 EXP 2 PhysioMimix LC12 30 μM (30 × C max ) 30 μM (4 × C max ) 30 μM (60 × C max ) 10 96-well plate 1, 10, 30 μM (1–30 × C max ) 1, 10, 30 μM (0.1–4 × C max ) 1, 10, 30 μM (2–60 × C max ) 4 EXP 3 and 4 PhysioMimix LC12 100 μM (100 × C max ) 200 μM (30 × C max ) 30 μM (60 × C max ) 10 96-well plate 1, 10, 30, 100 μM (1–100 × C max ) 1, 10, 30, 200 μM (0.1–30 × C max ) 1, 10, 30 μM (2–60 × C max ) 4",
  "other_cached_data_note": "GSE249010 is immune-stimulus multi-species data and does not directly supply the drug/context contract for this TG-GATEs chemical model. No alternative dataset is needed before the GSE330151 gated attempt.",
